  "_comment": "Tuning data for the particle emitters behind sparkle / hearts / dust-puff / spray / sparks (docs/effects.md). Content cannot ship emitters or set these values; only intensity, duration and color reach them. Conventions are SpriteKit's: angles in degrees counterclockwise with 0 = right (90 = up); gravity is points/s² with y up; scale is relative to the sticker's rendered size at the reference height. Emitters with \"worldGravity\" are tuned for Earth: the app scales their gravity by the pack world's (PackWorld) and lets them live longer where it is weak. An emitter with \"mirrored\" is drawn as a pair, itself and its mirror image across the vertical (emission angle and sideways gravity flipped): a cloud that billows out both ways. \"with\" names emitters that fire along with it, at the same spot, intensity and colour (the dust cloud's grains).",
